```
# Rust-specific ignores
target/
Cargo.lock

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Compiled and build artifacts
**/*.o
**/*.obj
**/*.a
**/*.lib
**/*.dll
**/*.so
**/*.dylib
**/*.exe

# Python artifacts (if any Python components)
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/

# Logs and temp files
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
.env.*

# Editors and IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Coverage reports
**/coverage/
**/htmlcov/
**/.coverage*

# Distribution and build artifacts
**/dist/
**/build/
**/target/
**/.gradle/
```